*> PLB-C106 unstring-space-not-all: UNSTRING into several items
*> DELIMITED BY SPACE without ALL.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. UNSPACE.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-NAME             PIC X(30) VALUE "JOHN  SMITH".
01  WS-FIRST            PIC X(15).
01  WS-LAST             PIC X(15).
01  WS-DELIM            PIC X.
01  WS-COUNT            PIC 99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    *> Reported: SPACE, SPACES, " ", and a space among others.
    UNSTRING WS-NAME DELIMITED BY SPACE INTO WS-FIRST WS-LAST
    UNSTRING WS-NAME DELIMITED SPACES
        INTO WS-FIRST DELIMITER IN WS-DELIM COUNT IN WS-COUNT
             WS-LAST
    UNSTRING WS-NAME DELIMITED BY "," OR " " INTO WS-FIRST WS-LAST
    *> Not reported: ALL SPACE, a space after ALL in a list, another
    *> delimiter, and one receiver.
    UNSTRING WS-NAME DELIMITED BY ALL SPACE INTO WS-FIRST WS-LAST
    UNSTRING WS-NAME DELIMITED BY "," OR ALL " " INTO WS-FIRST WS-LAST
    UNSTRING WS-NAME DELIMITED BY "," INTO WS-FIRST WS-LAST
    UNSTRING WS-NAME DELIMITED BY SPACE INTO WS-FIRST
    DISPLAY WS-FIRST WS-LAST WS-DELIM WS-COUNT
    STOP RUN.
